    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_set_theory_1_1_expander" kindref="compound">Expander</ref> - A callback function that can transform a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_record" kindref="compound">Record</ref> representing a set into a fully expanded list of elements. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Expanders provide a way for users to define named sets that can be used in DAG expressions. </para>
